ra-kadana-jadi-chao-he/","title":"Prabhāti Gīti"},"next":{"path":"/lv/udilo-aruna-puraba-bhage/","title":"Aruṇodoya-kīrtan 1"}}},"song":{"meta":{"page":[39,60],"first_line":"jaśomatī-nandana vraja-vara nāgara"},"title":["Śrī Nām-kīrtan"],"author":["Šrīla Bhaktivinoda Thākurs"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["jaśomatī-nandana    vraja-vara nāgara,","    gokula-rañjana kāna","gopī-parāṇa-dhana    madana manohara,","    kālīya-damana-vidhāna"],"translation":["Šrī Krišna ir mātes Jašodas mīļais dēls un Vrādžas zemes transcendentālais mīļotais. Viņu sajūsmā apbrīno visa Gokula! Viens no Viņa vārdiem ir Kāna. Viņš ir *gopiju* dzīvība un dvēsele. Viņš valdzina pašu Kupidonu un uzvar čūsku Kāliju."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["    amala harinām amiya-vilāsā","vipina-purandara    navīna nāgara-bora,","    vaṁśī-badana suvāsā"],"translation":["Krišnas Svētie Vārdi ir nevainojami tīri, tie ir saldas garšas un skaistuma pilni. Krišna ir Vrindāvanas mežu karalis. Viņš ir vienmēr jauns un krāšņs, Viņš ir labākais no visiem mīļotajiem. Uz savas flautas Viņš spēlē saldākās melodijas."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["vraja-jana-pālana    asura-kula-nāśana,","    nanda-godhana rākhoyālā","govinda mādhava    navanīta-taṣkara,","    sundara nanda-gopālā"],"translation":["Krišna pasargā visus Vrindāvanas mežu iemītniekus un uzvar dēmonus. Viņš gana govis un ir pazīstams kā Govinda – tas, kurš priecē gan govis, gan maņas. Viņš ir Mādhava, veiksmes dievietes vīrs. Krišna ir brīnišķais ganuzēns, Nanda Mahārādža dēls, kurš ļoti mīl zagt sviestu!"],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["yamunā-taṭa-chara    gopī-basana-hara,","    rāsa-rasika kṛpāmoya","śrī-rādhā-vallabha    vṛndāvana-naṭabara,","    bhakativinod-āśraya"],"translation":["Pastaigājoties pa Jamūnas upes krastiem, Krišna nolaupa peldošos *gopiju* drēbes. Viņš izbauda rāsas dejas saldo garšu! Viņš ir visžēlsirdīgākais! Viņš ir vienīgais Šrīmatī Rādharanī mīļotais. Krišna ir Vrindāvanas lieliskākais dejotājs un Šrīlas Bhaktivinoda Thākura augstākais patvērums!"],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-jasomati","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-yasomati-2","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-yasomati-1","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/govinda-maharaj-yasomati","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Nabadwip temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/navadwip-scsm-jasomati-nandana","personSlug":"nabadwip-temple"},{"title":"Srila B.B. Avadhut Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/avadxut-maxaradzh-utrennee-5","personSlug":"srila-b-b-avadhut-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.B. Avadhut Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/avadxut-maxaradzh-shri-nama","personSlug":"srila-b-b-avadhut-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.R. Madhusudan Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/madhusudan-maharaj-day-programm-kisel","personSlug":"srila-b-r-madhusudan-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.S. Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/goswami-maharaj-yasomati","personSlug":"srila-b-s-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Manasa Krishna Prabhu","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/huron/yasomati-nandana","personSlug":"manasa-krishna-prabhu"},{"title":"Caracas temple","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/shchsm-karakas-dzhashomati","personSlug":"caracas-temple"}]},"hasWbw":false,"hasVersesText":true,"hasVersesTranslations":true,"hasLongVerses":false,"fullInlineWbw":false},"telegraphUrl":"https://telegra.ph/Śrī-Nām-kīrtan-02-22-3"},"head":{"canonical":"/lv/jashomati-nandana-vraja-vara-nagara/","description":"Śrī Nām-kīrtan — vaišnavu dziesma ar vārdiem, tulkojumu latviešu valodā un skaidrojumu vārdu pa vārdam. Autors — Šrīla Bhaktivinoda Thākurs. No grāmatas «Gaudija Gītandžalī».","title":"Śrī Nām-kīrtan. Šrīla Bhaktivinoda Thākurs | Kirtan Site"},"kind":"song","route":{"kind":"item","bookId":"lv","slug":"jashomati-nandana-vraja-vara-nagara"}}